# Shopify Admin UI (J4G Inventory)

Target feel: Shopify Admin, Stripe Dashboard, GitHub, Linear — compact, calm, table-first, not colorful.

See [data-loading.mdc](data-loading.mdc) for async table patterns.

## App shell

- **Light sidebar**: `w-60 bg-neutral-100 border-gray-200`, links `text-[13px] h-9`, active `bg-white font-medium shadow-sm`
- **Slim top bar**: `h-12 bg-white border-b` — user + logout only
- **Content canvas**: `bg-gray-50`, full width `w-full px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-6` — no `max-w-7xl mx-auto`
- **Font**: Inter, base `text-[13px]`

## Page structure

```blade
<x-ui.page-header title="Categories">
    <x-slot:actions>
        <x-ui.button>Add Category</x-ui.button>
    </x-slot:actions>
</x-ui.page-header>

<x-ui.page-card>
    <x-slot:toolbar>...</x-slot:toolbar>
    <x-ui.async-table>...</x-ui.async-table>
</x-ui.page-card>
```

- Page title: `text-xl font-semibold`, header `mb-3`
- Primary CTA: top-right in `page-header` only — never full-width in toolbars

## Panels & tables

- Panel: `rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white shadow-sm`
- Toolbar: `px-3 py-2 border-b flex items-center gap-2`
- Table: `ui-table` — header `text-[12px] text-gray-500 bg-gray-50`, cells `px-3 py-2 text-[13px]`, row hover `bg-gray-50`
- Target row height: 40–44px — avoid `px-6 py-5`

## Buttons

- Primary: `h-9 px-3 text-[13px] bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800`
- Secondary: `h-9 border bg-white hover:bg-gray-50`
- Table actions: `ui-row-action` or `ui-row-more` dropdown — prefer Edit + More over many inline links
- Destructive: `ui-row-action-danger` or inside More dropdown with confirm

## Badges & status

- `text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full` — subtle green/amber/red/blue/gray
- Use `<x-ui.status-pill>` or `<x-ui.badge>` — never plain text

## Forms & modals

- Inputs: `h-9 text-[13px]`, labels `text-xs font-medium`
- Modal: `ui-modal-panel`, `ui-modal-header/body/footer` with `border-b` / `border-t`, `rounded-xl`, `max-w-md` or `max-w-lg`
- Form spacing: `space-y-4`; two columns on desktop where appropriate

## Dashboard

- Compact stat cards: `p-4`, label `text-xs`, value `text-xl`
- Grid: `grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3`
- Recent movements in `page-card` with compact section header

## Do NOT

- Huge cards, big fonts, large buttons, excessive whitespace
- Heavy shadows (`shadow-lg`, `shadow-xl`), `rounded-3xl`
- Rainbow UI, bright accents, marketing-page layouts
- Full-width primary buttons in toolbars
- Blade `@foreach` for large tables (use async `/data` endpoints)

## Components

`page-header`, `page-card`, `async-table`, `button`, `input`, `select`, `textarea`, `label`, `badge`, `status-pill`, `empty-state`, `stat-card`

## Real-time & toasts

- Pusher: update row only, `bg-yellow-50` highlight 1–2s, subtle toast
- Toasts: top-right desktop, bottom mobile, `text-[13px] shadow-sm`
- AJAX: disable button, show "Saving...", prevent double submit
